WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.269
Start with the decision your evidence needs to support, not with a perfect dataset.

2
00:00:05.219 --> 00:00:14.490
Tell us about the product, shipment, suppliers or public claim, and include your geography, timing and approximate volume.

3
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:20.675
The initial scope review is free and typically receives a first response within two working days.

4
00:00:20.675 --> 00:00:24.529
This static form does not transmit or store your entries.

5
00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:31.639
When you submit, it opens a pre-filled message in your email client, so you can review everything before sending.

6
00:00:31.639 --> 00:00:40.649
If the available evidence cannot support the requested statement, we will explain what is missing rather than promise an unsupported result.
